  "siteName": "Vercel News",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n   <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">AI Gateway spend budgets can now be scoped to a team or a project, in addition to individual API keys. Set a dollar limit on a scope, and the gateway meters spend against it and stops further requests once the limit is reached, until the budget resets or you raise it.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-none not-first:my-10 mx-0 max-[600px]:max-w-none max-[600px]:px-7 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pr-14 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pl-0 max-[600px]:w-full max-[600px]:mt-12 max-[600px]:mb-6\">\n     <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full\">\n      <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"Track spend against every team, project, and key budget from one overview.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full @max-[860px]:hidden @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)] p-3\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/26VMVwRso0PltsXsvRVZUZ/04d469ae744fc541f5220bdb92f5282d/3b68d3da-4474-48eb-b69d-ef4aeba13295.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/26VMVwRso0PltsXsvRVZUZ/04d469ae744fc541f5220bdb92f5282d/3b68d3da-4474-48eb-b69d-ef4aeba13295.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/26VMVwRso0PltsXsvRVZUZ/04d469ae744fc541f5220bdb92f5282d/3b68d3da-4474-48eb-b69d-ef4aeba13295.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"Track spend against every team, project, and key budget from one overview.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full @max-[860px]:hidden @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)] p-3\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2MehGPnjZuz4Eq01gD028J/5db070337431214dff23eddee9c2f433/a3aed22e-a2e6-498c-9945-fca9ca8f6a74.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2MehGPnjZuz4Eq01gD028J/5db070337431214dff23eddee9c2f433/a3aed22e-a2e6-498c-9945-fca9ca8f6a74.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2MehGPnjZuz4Eq01gD028J/5db070337431214dff23eddee9c2f433/a3aed22e-a2e6-498c-9945-fca9ca8f6a74.png\">\n     </div>\n     <figcaption class=\"text-copy-14 text-gray-900 text-center m-auto max-w-(--article-max-width) max-[600px]:px-0 max-[600px]:py-4\">Track spend against every team, project, and key budget from one overview.</figcaption>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#scopes\" id=\"scopes\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Scopes</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">A budget attaches to one of three scopes. A request can fall under multiple budgets and has to pass all of them: if any one is over its limit, the request is rejected, even when the others have room left.<!-- --></p>\n    <div class=\"scroller-module__aGa9CG__overlayContainer mb-10 mt-6 h-fit! max-w-full! @max-sm:my-2 w-fit! @max-sm:-mx-6 @max-sm:w-[calc(100%+51px)]! scroller-module__aGa9CG__isHorizontal\" data-geist-scroller=\"\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%\">\n     <div class=\"scroller-module__aGa9CG__scroller rounded-xl border border-gray-alpha-400 @max-sm:rounded-none @max-sm:border-none\" data-geist-scroller-container=\"\" data-overflow=\"x\">\n      <div>\n       <table class=\"bg-clip-padding shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-small)] @max-sm:rounded-none @max-sm:border-0 @max-sm:shadow-none [&amp;_tbody]:bg-background-100 @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:my-[-1px] @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:mb-2.5 @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:border-t @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:border-gray-400 @max-sm:[&amp;_tbody]:shadow-[0px_1px_2px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] [&amp;_th]:bg-background-200 [&amp;_th_p]:text-copy-16! [&amp;_th_p]:leading-6! [&amp;_th_p]:font-semibold [&amp;_th]:text-start [&amp;_td]:text-start [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_th]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_td]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_th]:px-6 [&amp;_th]:py-5 [&amp;_td]:px-6 [&amp;_td]:py-5 @max-sm:[&amp;_th]:min-w-[180px] @max-sm:[&amp;_td]:min-w-[180px] @max-sm:[&amp;_th]:p-4 @max-sm:[&amp;_td]:p-4 [&amp;_td_p]:inline-block [&amp;_td_p]:m-0 [&amp;_td_p]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_td_p]:leading-[140%] @max-sm:[&amp;_td_p]:text-copy-16 [&amp;_td_p_b]:font-medium [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_th:first-child]:border-l-0 [&amp;_td:first-child]:border-l-0 [&amp;_th:last-child]:border-r-0 [&amp;_td:last-child]:border-r-0 [&amp;_tr:first-child_th]:border-t-0 @max-sm:[&amp;_tr:first-child_th]:border-t @max-sm:[&amp;_tr:first-child_th]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_tr:first-child_td]:border-t-0 @max-sm:[&amp;_tr:first-child_td]:border-t @max-sm:[&amp;_tr:first-child_td]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_tr:last-child_th]:border-b-0 [&amp;_tr:last-child_td]:border-b-0 inline-block max-w-full! [&amp;_tbody]:inline-block [&amp;_tbody]:-m-px\">\n        <tbody>\n         <tr>\n          <th>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Scope</p>\n          </th>\n          <th>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Caps spend for</p>\n          </th>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Team<!-- --></p>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Every request your team runs through the gateway</p>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Project</p>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">All requests attributed to a single project</p>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n         <tr>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">API key</p>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">A single API key</p>\n          </td>\n         </tr>\n        </tbody>\n       </table>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">BYOK spend is not counted against budgets by default.</p>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#manage-budgets-in-the-dashboard\" id=\"manage-budgets-in-the-dashboard\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Manage budgets in the dashboard</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Set and track budgets from the <a href=\"https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai-gateway%2Fbudgets&amp;title=AI+Gateway+Budgets\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/d?to=%2F%5Bteam%5D%2F%7E%2Fai-gateway%2Fbudgets&amp;title=AI+Gateway+Budgets\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">AI Gateway Budgets tab</a>. The Overview breaks spend down across every scope against its limit, so you can see what is near or over before it starts rejecting requests.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-none not-first:my-10 mx-0 max-[600px]:max-w-none max-[600px]:px-7 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pr-14 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pl-0 max-[600px]:w-full max-[600px]:mt-12 max-[600px]:mb-6\">\n     <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full\">\n      <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"See budget health and refresh cadence across every scope at a glance.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full @max-[860px]:hidden @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)] p-3\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2mVxc1bQ6Xe72FqzPTnZTC/c90d2e5f2f67a28c2dedd00a5f437eef/CleanShot_2026-07-31_at_14.45.36_2x.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2mVxc1bQ6Xe72FqzPTnZTC/c90d2e5f2f67a28c2dedd00a5f437eef/CleanShot_2026-07-31_at_14.45.36_2x.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2mVxc1bQ6Xe72FqzPTnZTC/c90d2e5f2f67a28c2dedd00a5f437eef/CleanShot_2026-07-31_at_14.45.36_2x.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"See budget health and refresh cadence across every scope at a glance.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full @max-[860px]:hidden @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)] p-3\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/55u94S5JJ7yAyFzgh9cDBF/c05cd24158d000d0ec76dd77c8589539/CleanShot_2026-07-31_at_14.46.14_2x.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/55u94S5JJ7yAyFzgh9cDBF/c05cd24158d000d0ec76dd77c8589539/CleanShot_2026-07-31_at_14.46.14_2x.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/55u94S5JJ7yAyFzgh9cDBF/c05cd24158d000d0ec76dd77c8589539/CleanShot_2026-07-31_at_14.46.14_2x.png\">\n     </div>\n     <figcaption class=\"text-copy-14 text-gray-900 text-center m-auto max-w-(--article-max-width) max-[600px]:px-0 max-[600px]:py-4\">See budget health and refresh cadence across every scope at a glance.</figcaption>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Turn on email spend alerts to notify your team's usage notification recipients when usage crosses 50%, 75%, or 100% of a limit within a refresh period. Alerts are off by default and informational: they never block requests, only the budget limit does.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-none not-first:my-10 mx-0 max-[600px]:max-w-none max-[600px]:px-7 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pr-14 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pl-0 max-[600px]:w-full max-[600px]:mt-12 max-[600px]:mb-6\">\n     <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full\">\n      <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"Set a per-project or per-API key budget with refresh periods and email notifications.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full @max-[860px]:hidden @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)] p-3\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2gqw3zZOc5YzYsNUmxggkg/4888194b77f0d406569555ef8c5eab8b/c3b9afe0-8b02-41b4-9fdf-fff96b64f2aa.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2gqw3zZOc5YzYsNUmxggkg/4888194b77f0d406569555ef8c5eab8b/c3b9afe0-8b02-41b4-9fdf-fff96b64f2aa.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2gqw3zZOc5YzYsNUmxggkg/4888194b77f0d406569555ef8c5eab8b/c3b9afe0-8b02-41b4-9fdf-fff96b64f2aa.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"Set a per-project or per-API key budget with refresh periods and email notifications.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full @max-[860px]:hidden @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)] p-3\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6Je9Xrd2sNfllfl6wloFku/0e9bdd3cbf81136a89690c440c7d263f/dfc4f598-b1e2-4cbe-856d-b57a626581f9.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6Je9Xrd2sNfllfl6wloFku/0e9bdd3cbf81136a89690c440c7d263f/dfc4f598-b1e2-4cbe-856d-b57a626581f9.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6Je9Xrd2sNfllfl6wloFku/0e9bdd3cbf81136a89690c440c7d263f/dfc4f598-b1e2-4cbe-856d-b57a626581f9.png\">\n     </div>\n     <figcaption class=\"text-copy-14 text-gray-900 text-center m-auto max-w-(--article-max-width) max-[600px]:px-0 max-[600px]:py-4\">Set a per-project or per-API key budget with refresh periods and email notifications.</figcaption>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Set a default budget for projects or API keys, and every one without an explicit budget inherits it automatically. An explicit budget always overrides the default.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 max-w-none not-first:my-10 mx-0 max-[600px]:max-w-none max-[600px]:px-7 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pr-14 max-[600px]:in-[li]:pl-0 max-[600px]:w-full max-[600px]:mt-12 max-[600px]:mb-6\">\n     <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full\">\n      <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"Track spend against every budget from the dashboard.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.dark-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full @max-[860px]:hidden @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)] p-3\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/4JmlMMPpSFrDvNZNjSx6P5/3cfb234024b845286d439b2e0bbea957/48281962-b2c8-4b65-a8f7-62c043db2b01.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/4JmlMMPpSFrDvNZNjSx6P5/3cfb234024b845286d439b2e0bbea957/48281962-b2c8-4b65-a8f7-62c043db2b01.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/4JmlMMPpSFrDvNZNjSx6P5/3cfb234024b845286d439b2e0bbea957/48281962-b2c8-4b65-a8f7-62c043db2b01.png\"><img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"Track spend against every budget from the dashboard.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"[.light-theme_&amp;]:hidden! h-auto max-w-full @max-[860px]:hidden @max-[860px]:w-[var(--article-full-width)] p-3\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2f2fiu4CzOsa8ktFopbj9d/b0351cde2c99c5d8c96f8bfed3680431/5ea4ae41-f4f3-4d40-9e64-fd2c1dff7050.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2f2fiu4CzOsa8ktFopbj9d/b0351cde2c99c5d8c96f8bfed3680431/5ea4ae41-f4f3-4d40-9e64-fd2c1dff7050.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/2f2fiu4CzOsa8ktFopbj9d/b0351cde2c99c5d8c96f8bfed3680431/5ea4ae41-f4f3-4d40-9e64-fd2c1dff7050.png\">\n     </div>\n     <figcaption class=\"text-copy-14 text-gray-900 text-center m-auto max-w-(--article-max-width) max-[600px]:px-0 max-[600px]:py-4\">Track spend against every budget from the dashboard.</figcaption>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"pt-[calc(var(--grid-divider-gap)/1.5)] in-[#changelog-description]:pt-6 text-heading-32 font-normal! leading-[1.1]! [&amp;:has(_b)]:text-gray-900 [&amp;_b]:font-normal [&amp;_b]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap group relative w-full text-balance\"><a class=\"scroll-mt-[90px] flex items-center justify-center flex-col absolute left-0 bottom-0 mt-auto mb-auto w-8 h-[1lh] max-h-8 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 -translate-x-full duration-100 transition-all text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-1000 focus-visible:opacity-100\" href=\"#manage-budgets-from-the-cli\" id=\"manage-budgets-from-the-cli\"> \n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n       <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.47 1.47a4.29 4.29 0 1 1 6.06 6.06l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06 2.5-2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 0-3.94-3.94l-2.5 2.5-1.06-1.06zm3.06 4.06-6 6-1.06-1.06 6-6zm-10.06 9a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 6.06 0l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a2.79 2.79 0 0 1-3.94-3.94l2.5-2.5-1.06-1.06-2.5 2.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 0 0 6.06\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n      </svg> \n      <span class=\"sr-only\">Copy link to heading</span> \n     </a>Manage budgets from the CLI</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">Set, inspect, and remove team and project budgets from the CLI. The refresh period is <code>daily</code>, <code>weekly</code>, <code>monthly</code> (default), or <code>none</code> for a cumulative cap.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-stretch justify-start gap-4 flex-initial blog-code-block-module__TEKDOa__wrapper\">\n     <div class=\"my-4 rounded-md group/copy relative overflow-hidden border border-[var(--ds-gray-400)] blog-code-block-module__TEKDOa__codeBlock\" data-geist-code-block=\"\">\n      <button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" aria-label=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-testid=\"copy/button\" class=\"outline-none m-0 border-0 align-baseline no-underline group/trigger relative cursor-pointer select-none transform translate-z-0 flex text-[var(--themed-fg,_var(--ds-background-100))] bg-[var(--themed-bg,_var(--ds-gray-1000))] font-medium max-w-full items-center justify-center transition-[border-color, background,color,