=\"display:inline-block\">\n</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L4\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\"># Scope a budget to a single project</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L5\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">vercel ai-gateway budgets </span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">set</span><span class=\"token plain\"> project my-project </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\">--limit</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token plain\"> --refresh-period monthly</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L6\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\">\n</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L7\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\"># Set a default for projects or keys without their own budget</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L8\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">vercel ai-gateway budgets defaults </span><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">set</span><span class=\"token plain\"> project </span><span class=\"token parameter variable\">--limit</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token number\">200</span><span class=\"token plain\"> --refresh-period monthly</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L9\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\">\n</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L10\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\"># List every budget</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L11\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">vercel ai-gateway budgets list</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L12\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\">\n</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L13\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token comment\"># Remove a budget</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C49a004e4-L14\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">vercel ai-gateway budgets remove team</span></div></div></code></pre>\n     </div>\n     <p class=\"text-center text-copy-14 text-gray-900\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\">For more information, read the <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway/observability-and-spend/budgets\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway/observability-and-spend/budgets\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-[var(--geist-link-color)] [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:underline [&amp;_u]:no-underline underline decoration-1 underline-offset-2 text-inherit! hover:decoration-1! hover:text-(--geist-link-color)! focus-visible:outline-offset-2\">budgets documentation</a>.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap [&amp;_a:hover_code]:text-(--geist-link-color)\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <section class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) flex flex-col gap-4 mt-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-label-14 font-medium\">Contributors</h2>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-gray-900\">\n     <p class=\"text-copy-14 text-pretty\"><a href=\"https://github.com/kevinsundstrom\" rel=\"author\" target=\"_blank\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 hover:underline\">Kevin Sundstrom</a></p>\n    </div>\n   </section>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Vercel 的 AI 网关新增团队和项目级支出预算功能，可按范围限制 AI API 成本、设置默认限制并接收邮件警报。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Vercel 的 AI 网关新增团队和项目级支出预算功能，可按范围限制 AI API 成本、设置默认限制并接收邮件警报。",
  "summary": "Vercel 扩展了 AI 网关的支出控制功能，新增团队和项目级预算范围，补充了现有 API 密钥级限制。更新日志详细说明了团队、项目和 API 密钥三种预算范围，指出请求可能同时适用多个预算且需通过所有限制。默认排除 BYOK 支出。预算通过新网关预算仪表板标签配置和跟踪，显示支出健康状态，且可选邮件警报在 50%、75% 和 100% 阈值触发通知，但警报不会阻断请求。默认预算可设定给项目或密钥，显式预算优先级高。团队和项目预算也支持通过 CLI 管理，支持每日、每周、每月或累计刷新周期。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "预算可针对团队、项目或 API 密钥设置，且请求必须通过所有适用的预算限制。",
      "explanation": "若任一范围超出限制，请求将被拒绝，即使其他范围仍有容量，形成分层成本控制。"
    },
    {
      "point": "默认预算允许每个项目或密钥继承限制，除非设定显式预算。",
      "explanation": "显式预算始终覆盖默认值，为团队提供安全保障，无需手动逐项目配置。"
    },
    {
      "point": "支出警报在刷新周期内的 50%、75% 和 100% 阈值触发，仅发出通知不阻断流量。",
      "explanation": "警报仅为信息提示，绝不阻断请求；只有硬性预算限制会拒绝请求。"
    },
    {
      "point": "CLI 支持设置、检查和删除预算，支持每日、每周、每月或累计刷新周期。",
      "explanation": "通过 vercel ai-gateway budgets 命令可在终端管理预算，融入部署工作流。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "请求可能同时适用多个预算，必须通过所有限制：若任一预算超出限制，请求将被拒绝，即使其他预算仍有剩余额度。",
    "警报默认关闭且为信息性通知：绝不阻断请求，仅硬性预算限制生效。",
    "为项目或 API 密钥设置默认预算，所有未设显式预算的项目/密钥将自动继承默认值。"
  ],
